From d83c032e126d6fce1682327bc42867c4566c304a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:20:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] POC-10c: FOLDER screen, candy shop, move icons on chips, more
 chip sources

- Custom screen: shared chips show a BN-style icon of the move; only partner
  switch chips show a Pokemon (Khaled, 2026-10-05)
- START menu -> FOLDER: Folder / Pack / Candy pages. Edit the folder (saved in
  pkbn.sav; SELECT = auto), PP Up (+1 copy) / PP Max (to the cap) on pack chips,
  candy shop (level-gated by Pokemon you own, MB/4 candy, +2 for another code)
- TMs/HMs bought or found give 2 copies; the Move Relearner gives a copy in a
  code you lack; releasing gives candy; hatchlings bring egg moves; Pokedex
  milestones (PP Up / 10 species, PP Max / 50); shiny catches give * copies

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
